WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.000
Vegans Explore is the Vegan community's home base,
and you can start using it today, free.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.580
Find Vegan restaurants, brands, rescues,

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.300
and sanctuaries in your city ranked by member vouches.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.080
Listen to podcasts and watch videos
from Vegan creators, right here on the platform.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.880
Open the Guides, and see what's happening in your city.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.880
As a member, you take part and vouch for the

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.040
places you love, check in,

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.699
and take on bounties for points you can give back.

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:36.319
And what we build next comes from you.

00:00:37.519 --> 00:00:42.919
Become a Founding Member free with a short survey
before January 1, or start exploring today.

